Subject: [PATCH] ffmpeg: gate hardware filter on its actual dependencies

CPU-only MiniDLNA builds must not compile the backported V4L2 M2M filter
without DRM headers. Add the missing configure dependencies and bump the
library package release.
---
--- a/multimedia/ffmpeg/Makefile
+++ b/multimedia/ffmpeg/Makefile
@@ -28 +28 @@
-PKG_RELEASE:=1
+PKG_RELEASE:=2
--- /dev/null
+++ b/multimedia/ffmpeg/patches/200-deinterlace-v4l2m2m-dependencies.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
