+Subject: [PATCH] ffmpeg: declare dependencies of V4L2 M2M deinterlacing
+
+The backported filter includes DRM headers and uses V4L2 M2M, but its
+dependencies were not declared. Do not build it when either backend is
+disabled, as in the BE7000 MiniDLNA configuration.
+---
+--- a/configure
++++ b/configure
+@@ -4193,2 +4193,3 @@
+ deinterlace_vaapi_filter_deps="vaapi"
++deinterlace_v4l2m2m_filter_deps="v4l2_m2m libdrm"
+ delogo_filter_deps="gpl"
